 "title": "Automotive single 2-input AND gate, 1.65 V to 5.5 V",
 "source": {
  "revision": "SCES556H, revised August 2026",
  "pages": 30
 },
 "summary": "SN74LVC1G08-Q1: one 2-input AND gate (Y = A · B) qualified to AEC-Q100 grade 1 for automotive use. It runs from 1.65 V to 5.5 V; its inputs take up to 5.5 V whatever the supply, so it can shift a signal down to VCC. The output sources and sinks 24 mA at 3 V and 32 mA at 4.5 V, supply current stays under 10 µA, and Ioff keeps inputs and output from back-driving the part when VCC is 0 V. It comes in SOT-23 (DBV), SC70 (DCK) and 6-pin SON (DRY) packages.",
 "key_figures": [
